WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.197
Your AI agents never stop working. Now, you can watch them do it.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.673
Meet Lucid Agent Worlds. Every agent in your fleet becomes a character, in a world you choose.

3
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:16.612
Give them real work. Build a HIPAA-ready intake API. Add audit logging. Ship a hardened checkout.

4
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:23.977
When an agent needs permission, it raises its hand. Approve, deny, or set it to auto, right from the world.

5
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:31.370
With their subagents, they build. Mini games and tools rise on digital scaffolding, and open in a secure sandbox.

6
00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:38.266
Behind every world is the real thing. Fleet lanes working in parallel, and one composer to direct them all.

7
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:44.934
Every tool call passes LUCID's security gate. Every change is scanned, logged, and approved.

8
00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:52.416
Christmas. Football. Soccer. Basketball. Baseball. Hockey. Twenty-nine worlds, and a hundred more on the way.

9
00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:56.440
Pick one, grab a bundle, or unlock them all, in the LUCID store.

10
00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:04.752
LUCID. Security-first agentic AI, building production-grade apps and systems, built to pass regulated security reviews.

